{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"e510000000000101","type":"group","x":0,"y":450,"width":1000,"height":1480,"label":"01 · 识别未计入的影响","color":"5"},
		{"id":"e510000000000102","type":"group","x":1240,"y":450,"width":1000,"height":1480,"label":"02 · 数量基准与内部化","color":"5"},
		{"id":"e510000000000103","type":"group","x":2480,"y":450,"width":1000,"height":1480,"label":"03 · 协商与产权","color":"6"},
		{"id":"e510000000000104","type":"group","x":0,"y":2170,"width":1000,"height":1480,"label":"04 · 协商为何受阻","color":"6"},
		{"id":"e510000000000105","type":"group","x":1240,"y":2170,"width":1000,"height":1480,"label":"05 · 税费与税基","color":"4"},
		{"id":"e510000000000106","type":"group","x":2480,"y":2170,"width":1000,"height":1480,"label":"06 · 补贴与标准","color":"4"},
		{"id":"e510000000000107","type":"group","x":0,"y":3890,"width":1000,"height":1480,"label":"07 · 多企业分担与总目标","color":"2"},
		{"id":"e510000000000108","type":"group","x":1240,"y":3890,"width":1000,"height":1480,"label":"08 · 交易制度与配额账户","color":"2"},
		{"id":"e510000000000109","type":"group","x":2480,"y":3890,"width":1000,"height":2000,"label":"09 · 不确定性与可执行性","color":"3"},
		{"id":"e510000000000001","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":3480,"height":270,"text":"# 外部性与内部化政策\n\n[[02_Economy/02_public finance财政学/03_外部性与政策选择|从连续课程开始]]\n\n按编号逐行阅读：识别影响 → 确定数量基准 → 比较协商和政策 → 分担减排 → 核对交易、风险与执行。颜色区分问题类型。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nRead each row in numbered order: identify the effect, establish the quantity benchmark, compare bargaining and policy, allocate abatement, then check trading, uncertainty and implementation. Colours distinguish question types.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->","color":"5"},
		{"id":"e510000000000201","type":"text","x":50,"y":550,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[外部性]]\n\n他人得失没有充分进入行动者的选择激励。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nEffects on others are not fully reflected in the actor's incentives.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000205","type":"text","x":600,"y":550,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[金钱外部性]]\n\n先辨认经由价格的得失，不能只凭别人少赚钱判定效率损失。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nIdentify price-mediated effects; another person's lost income alone does not establish an efficiency loss.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000202","type":"text","x":50,"y":1090,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[边际外部损害]]\n\n下一单位的损害不同于总损害或平均损害；先统一活动单位。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nMarginal, total and average damage differ. Align activity units before comparing them.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000801","type":"text","x":50,"y":1610,"width":900,"height":250,"text":"把遗漏项写进社会账户，还没有改变私人行为。去②用[[外部性数量偏离|数量条件]]比较选择，再用[[外部性内部化|内部化]]检查激励是否改变。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAdding a missing effect to social accounts does not itself change behaviour. In 02, compare choices through the [[外部性数量偏离|quantity conditions]], then test [[外部性内部化|internalisation]] of the incentive.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->","color":"5"},
		{"id":"e510000000000220","type":"text","x":1290,"y":550,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[产量、排放与减排]]\n\n固定基准下，减排增加意味着排放减少；不一定需要减产。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nWith a fixed baseline, more abatement means fewer emissions, not necessarily less output.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000203","type":"text","x":1840,"y":550,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[外部性数量偏离|单一外部性的数量偏离]]\n\n通常竞争内点条件下，负外溢使活动过多，正外溢使活动不足。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nUnder standard interior competitive conditions, a single negative spillover yields too much activity; a positive one yields too little.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000204","type":"text","x":1290,"y":1090,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[最优污染边界|最优污染的可行边界]]\n\n比较边际收益与损害，也检查零排放和上界。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCompare marginal returns and damage, checking zero emissions and the upper bound as well.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000206","type":"text","x":1840,"y":1090,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[外部性内部化]]\n\n让原先遗漏的他人得失进入下一单位行动的取舍。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nBring previously omitted effects on others into the marginal choice.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000802","type":"text","x":1290,"y":1610,"width":900,"height":250,"text":"社会最优是评价基准，实施方法另选：去③看[[科斯定理|协商基准]]，去⑤看[[庇古税|边际损害校准]]。两者都须另外检查实现条件。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe efficient quantity is an evaluation benchmark; implementation remains a separate choice. See [[科斯定理|bargaining]] in 03 and [[庇古税|marginal-damage calibration]] in 05, each with its own implementation conditions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->","color":"5"},
		{"id":"e510000000000208","type":"text","x":2530,"y":550,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[科斯定理]]\n\n明确可交易权利与无成本有效协商，给出内部化的效率基准。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nClear tradable rights and costless efficient bargaining provide a benchmark for internalisation.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000207","type":"text","x":3080,"y":550,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[外部性谈判区间|减排行为的补偿区间]]\n\n无谈判执行成本、转移可行且估值稳定时，避免损害超过行动者损失，便有双方受益的支付区间。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nWith costless bargaining and enforcement, feasible transfers and stable valuations, avoided harm exceeding the actor's loss allows mutual gains.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000209","type":"text","x":2530,"y":1090,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[科斯产权不变性|产权变化与最终数量]]\n\n同一唯一有效量还需无财富效应与可行转移；分配仍会改变。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe same unique quantity additionally requires absent wealth effects and feasible transfers; distribution still changes.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000211","type":"text","x":3080,"y":1090,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[合并内部化]]\n\n共同组织把相关收益与损害放进同一目标，但仍有覆盖和管理边界。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nIntegration combines returns and harm in one objective, subject to coverage and management limits.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000803","type":"text","x":2530,"y":1610,"width":900,"height":250,"text":"协议有共同增益不保证谈得成。去④分别识别[[交易成本|资源耗用]]、[[钳制问题|必要许可的否决权]]与[[公共品搭便车|非排他收益下的出资激励]]。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAvailable joint gains do not guarantee agreement. In 04 distinguish [[交易成本|resource costs]], [[钳制问题|veto power over indispensable permission]] and [[公共品搭便车|contribution incentives under non-excludable benefits]].\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->","color":"6"},
		{"id":"e510000000000210","type":"text","x":50,"y":2270,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[交易成本]]\n\n寻找、订约和监督执行消耗资源，不能与协议付款混算。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSearch, contracting and enforcement use resources; distinguish these from transfers agreed between parties.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000212","type":"text","x":600,"y":2270,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[钳制问题]]\n\n不可缺少的权利持有人利用否决能力要求更多交易收益。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAn indispensable rights holder can use veto power to demand more of the gains from agreement.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000301","type":"text","x":600,"y":2810,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[公共品搭便车|非排他收益与搭便车]]\n\n希望别人出资而自己分享改善，可能使私人供给不足。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nBenefiting while others contribute can leave private provision below the efficient level.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000804","type":"text","x":50,"y":3330,"width":900,"height":250,"text":"资源成本、策略索价和搭便车是不同机制。去⑤/⑥比较可执行工具；到⑨用[[政府失灵|明确评价标准与可行对照]]审视公共方案，而非由协商困难直接判定哪种制度最好。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nResource costs, strategic demands and free riding are different mechanisms. Compare feasible instruments in 05–06, then assess public alternatives with [[政府失灵|explicit criteria and a feasible comparator]] in 09. Bargaining difficulty alone does not rank institutions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->","color":"6"},
		{"id":"e510000000000221","type":"text","x":1290,"y":2270,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[庇古税]]\n\n第一最佳中，以最优点的边际外部损害校准单位税率。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nIn the first-best benchmark, calibrate the unit rate to marginal external damage at the optimum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000222","type":"text","x":1840,"y":2270,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[排污费]]\n\n按剩余排放收费；固定框架的企业将边际减排成本与费率比较。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCharging remaining emissions makes a firm compare marginal abatement cost with the rate in the stated fixed framework.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000223","type":"text","x":1290,"y":2810,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[庇古税与损害赔偿|边际税率、税收与赔偿]]\n\n校准行为、累计损害和实际付给受害者的金额，是三个问题。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nBehavioural calibration, total damage and payments reaching victims are three separate questions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000227","type":"text","x":1840,"y":2810,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[产量税与排放税|产量税基与排放税基]]\n\n排放强度能调整时，纯产量税漏掉保持产量而少排污的直接奖励。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nWith adjustable emissions intensity, a pure output tax misses the direct reward for cleaner production at unchanged output.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000805","type":"text","x":1290,"y":3330,"width":900,"height":250,"text":"税率、税基和政府收款分别核对。去⑥比较[[税费与补贴的减排激励|同率税费与补贴]]；去⑦看[[共同排放价格与减排分担|统一价格的跨企业分担]]，仍须说明总目标怎样确定。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCheck the rate, base and public receipts separately. Compare [[税费与补贴的减排激励|equal-rate charges and subsidies]] in 06, then [[共同排放价格与减排分担|common-price allocation across firms]] in 07, keeping target choice explicit.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->","color":"4"},
		{"id":"e510000000000224","type":"text","x":2530,"y":2270,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[按量减排补贴]]\n\n相对核定基准少排一单位才获得支付；基准减排不自动等于额外改善。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nPayment rewards reductions against a stated baseline; eligible reductions are not automatically additional improvements.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000225","type":"text","x":3080,"y":2270,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[税费与补贴的减排激励|税费与补贴的边际等价条件]]\n\n同率、同一可行选择且基准和参与者固定时，可选同一减排量；利润、预算和进入激励仍不同。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nEqual rates, identical feasible choices, fixed baselines and participants can give equal abatement, not equal profits, budgets or entry incentives.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000226","type":"text","x":2530,"y":2810,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[正外部性补贴]]\n\n奖励活动者没有取得的外溢收益；同一外部收益只能计一次。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nReward spillover benefits the actor does not capture, counting each benefit only once.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000228","type":"text","x":3080,"y":2810,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[排放标准与技术标准|结果约束与技术要求]]\n\n绩效标准规定排放表现；技术标准指定控制手段，灵活性与核实难度不同。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nPerformance standards specify emissions outcomes; technology standards prescribe methods, with different flexibility and verification demands.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000806","type":"text","x":2530,"y":3330,"width":900,"height":250,"text":"按量补贴、正外溢补贴与标准分别作用于不同对象。去⑦用[[成本有效减排|给定目标的边际条件]]检验分担；去⑧用[[排放配额与减排信用|反事实减排]]检验基准奖励的额外性。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAbatement subsidies, positive-spillover subsidies and standards address different objects. Test allocation with [[成本有效减排|fixed-target marginal conditions]] in 07, and baseline rewards with [[排放配额与减排信用|counterfactual reductions]] in 08.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->","color":"4"},
		{"id":"e510000000000240","type":"text","x":50,"y":3990,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[成本有效减排|给定目标的成本有效分担]]\n\n凸成本条件下，内点边际减排成本相等，角点另用不等式。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor convex costs, interior marginal abatement costs are equal; corners require inequalities.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000241","type":"text","x":600,"y":3990,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[共同排放价格与减排分担|共同价格实现减排分担]]\n\n统一税率与竞争配额价都可分散实现最低成本分担，工具锁定的变量不同。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nUniform charges and competitive allowance prices can decentralise least-cost abatement, while fixing different policy variables.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000245","type":"text","x":50,"y":4530,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[成本有效与社会最优|最低成本与最优总量]]\n\n先求给定减排的最低成本，再把环境收益纳入总量选择。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFirst minimise cost for a given abatement target; then include environmental benefits when choosing that target.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000302","type":"text","x":600,"y":4530,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[转移支付核算]]\n\n同边界、时期和货币权重下匹配付款与收款，资源成本只计一次。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nMatch payments and receipts within the same boundary, period and monetary weights; count resource costs once.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000807","type":"text","x":50,"y":5050,"width":900,"height":250,"text":"共同价格回答谁来减排，不替代最优总量或分配判断。去⑧看[[总量排放交易|总预算与交易]]怎样实现数量约束；回②[[最优污染边界|边际权衡与端点]]检验总目标。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA common price allocates abatement without settling the optimal total or distribution. See [[总量排放交易|budgets and trading]] in 08 for the quantity constraint, and return to [[最优污染边界|marginal trade-offs and boundaries]] in 02 to assess the target.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->","color":"2"},
		{"id":"e510000000000242","type":"text","x":1290,"y":3990,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[总量排放交易]]\n\n设定覆盖范围内的总预算，允许配额转让，并按核定排放缴回。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSet a covered emissions budget, permit allowance transfers, and require surrender against verified emissions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000243","type":"text","x":1840,"y":3990,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[初始配额中性|初始配额中性的条件]]\n\n在竞争等条件下，固定禀赋若不改变边际激励与可行选择，可保持最终减排配置。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nUnder the stated competitive conditions, a fixed endowment that leaves marginal incentives and feasible choices unchanged preserves final abatement.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000249","type":"text","x":1290,"y":4530,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[排放配额与减排信用|配额预算与项目减排信用]]\n\n配额来自总预算；信用来自相对基准的核证减排，还须检验额外性。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAllowances come from a budget; credits represent verified baseline-relative reductions whose additionality must be assessed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000244","type":"text","x":1840,"y":4530,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[配额净交易与边际减排|净买卖与边际减排行动]]\n\n基础单期账户中，净买卖为排放减初始配额；低成本减排者仍可能净买。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nIn the baseline one-period account, net trades equal emissions minus initial allowances; a low-cost abater can still be a net buyer.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000808","type":"text","x":1290,"y":5050,"width":900,"height":250,"text":"总预算、初始资产和减排信用不是同一账户项目。去⑨用[[排放监测与履约|计量与缴回]]核对义务，再以[[排放总量与局地损害|空间影响]]检查同吨交易是否保持所需环境效果。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe total budget, initial assets and credits are distinct account items. In 09 reconcile obligations through [[排放监测与履约|measurement and surrender]], then test [[排放总量与局地损害|spatial impacts]] of equal-ton trades.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->","color":"2"},
		{"id":"e510000000000246","type":"text","x":2530,"y":3990,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[价格与数量选择|成本不确定时选价格或数量]]\n\n已知收益、成本冲击与局部内点模型下，福利比较看边际收益和成本的相对斜率，而非企业成本差异。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nWith known benefits, cost shocks and local interior responses, welfare depends on relative marginal slopes, not cost differences across firms.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000247","type":"text","x":3080,"y":3990,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[排放价格走廊]]\n\n上下限必须配上可信干预与数量能力；触及边界可改变原总量。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nPrice bounds require credible intervention and quantity capacity; reaching a bound can change the original emissions total.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000248","type":"text","x":2530,"y":4530,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[排放监测与履约|排放计量与配额履约]]\n\n统一范围与期间，处理缺值和质量，再对齐排放义务与有效配额缴回。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAlign coverage and periods, address missing data and quality, then reconcile emissions obligations with valid allowances surrendered.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000250","type":"text","x":3080,"y":4530,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[排放总量与局地损害|同吨交易与局地环境目标]]\n\n排放总吨数不变，仍可能因来源地点不同而改变受体暴露与损害。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nUnchanged emissions tonnage can still alter exposure and damage when source locations differ.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000303","type":"text","x":2530,"y":5070,"width":350,"height":350,"text":"[[政府失灵]]\n\n政府无法或不愿主要服务公民利益；具体判断需标准、机制与可行对照。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nGovernment may be unable or unwilling to serve citizens' interests; a diagnosis requires criteria, mechanisms and a feasible comparator.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"e510000000000809","type":"text","x":2530,"y":5580,"width":900,"height":250,"text":"走廊、监测和空间规则改变可实现的结果，也耗用资源。回[[02_Economy/02_public finance财政学/03_外部性与政策选择#7. 把配置、钱款和制度放回同一张账|课程⑦的完整账户]]比较制度；有外部性或目标未达成本身，都不足以完成政策优劣判断。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCollars, monitoring and spatial rules affect feasible outcomes and use resources. Return to [[02_Economy/02_public finance财政学/03_外部性与政策选择#7. 把配置、钱款和制度放回同一张账|the full account in lesson 7]] to compare institutions. An externality or a missed target alone does not rank policies.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->","color":"3"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e510000000001001","fromNode":"e510000000000201","fromSide":"right","toNode":"e510000000000205","toSide":"left","label":"辨认渠道"},
		{"id":"e510000000001002","fromNode":"e510000000000201","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"e510000000000202","toSide":"top","label":"边际计量"},
		{"id":"e510000000001003","fromNode":"e510000000000220","fromSide":"right","toNode":"e510000000000203","toSide":"left","label":"统一变量"},
